# Local AI handoff reports
.claude-handoff/
docs/workmd

# scripts/harness verify-change.ps1 report areas (docs/harness/GATE_MATRIX.md) -
# .harness/reports/ is written by the harness itself, one subdirectory per
# run id, never overwritten/reused. .harness/imported-reports/ holds only
# user-copied historical evidence; the harness never writes to it.
.harness/reports/
.harness/imported-reports/
